And rose and rose, and rose and rose;
And rose and rose, and rose and rose, and rose and rose;
And rose and rose, and rose and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and rose, and

And you cannot hold his breath;
He exclaims, "My Spirit!"

You forget him; you forgive him;
When he complains, "My Spirit!"

'T was yesterday, my time was just last;
'T was just yesterday, my time was just last;
'T was just yesterday, my time was just last;
'T was just yesterday, my time was just last;
'T was just yesterday, my time was just last;
'T was just yesterday, my time was just last;
